# 🚀 CompApps Department Website

## 📌 Overview

The **CompApps Department Website** is a modern, responsive web application designed to showcase the activities, achievements, and opportunities within the Computer Applications Department.

This project highlights:

* Department overview and mission
* Events and workshops
* Gallery of activities
* Student engagement (Join/Contact)
* Clean UI with dark/light theme support

The goal of this website is to provide a **professional, user-friendly platform** for students and visitors to explore the department.

---

## ✨ Features

* 🌗 Dark / Light Mode Toggle
* 📱 Fully Responsive Design (Mobile + Desktop)
* 🎬 Smooth Scroll Animations (AOS)
* 🧩 Reusable Components (Navbar & Footer)
* 🖼️ Interactive Gallery with Hover Effects
* 📅 Event Listings with Clean UI
* 📬 Contact / Join Form Section
* 🎨 Modern UI with Glassmorphism & Glow Effects

---

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

### 🔹 Frontend

* HTML5
* CSS3
* JavaScript (Vanilla JS)

### 🔹 Frameworks & Libraries

* Bootstrap 5 (Layout & Responsiveness)
* Bootstrap Icons
* AOS (Animate On Scroll Library)

### 🔹 Concepts Implemented

* Component-based structure (Navbar & Footer loading)
* CSS Variables (Design System)
* Theme Switching (Dark/Light Mode)
* Responsive Grid System
* Modular CSS Architecture

---

